{"id": "EUVD-2026-41875", "enisaUuid": "98075140-8c40-3db4-a548-4ce473e4bb27", "description": "A flaw was found in GIMP's PNM file format parser. When parsing a specially crafted PNM file, the pnmscanner_gettoken() function writes a null terminator one byte past the end of a stack-allocated buffer due to an off-by-one error in the loop boundary check. This could lead to memory corruption, potentially resulting in denial of service or arbitrary code execution.", "datePublished": "2026-07-06T13:58:43", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-12T02:14:30", "baseScore": 7.3, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:40751", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:62507", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:73768", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:80509", "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-58380", "https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2496135", "https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gimp/-/commit/83699817", "https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gimp/-/issues/16206"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-58380", "GHSA-c7fj-r3pq-5ph5"], "assigner": "redhat", "epss": 0.26, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "14903498-c356-3c27-a9bb-e442578453c4", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Enterprise Linux 9.4 Update Services for SAP Solutions", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 2:2.99.8-4.el9_4.19"}, {"id": "80a3ce4e-3bc6-38b8-909c-9b7eb03e102f", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Enterprise Linux 9.6 Extended Update Support", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 2:2.99.8-4.el9_6.20"}, {"id": "d062fed1-bb1c-3b27-bcdc-38ef2235b058", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Enterprise Linux 9", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 2:3.0.4-4.el9_8.7"}, {"id": "dc4784ab-adce-313c-897f-e6c401cf2cf9", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Enterprise Linux 8", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 8100020260824165450.4c9c024f"}], "e